flowchart TB
  User[Quantum scientists / students / educators] -->|HTTPS| Nginx[Nginx on Amazon EC2]
  subgraph EC2[Amazon EC2 or AgentCore Runtime]
    UI[Simple podcast website] --> API[Flask backend API]
    API --> Editor[Strands Weekly Editor agent loop]
    Worker[Podcast worker] --> Editor
    Editor --> Tools[Agent tools: arXiv Scout / Category Editor / Paper Listener / Evidence Editor / Podcast Writer / Publisher]
  end
  Scheduler[Amazon EventBridge Scheduler] --> SQS[Amazon SQS + DLQ] --> Worker
  Tools --> Arxiv[Official arXiv export API]
  Editor <--> Bedrock[Amazon Bedrock]
  Editor --> DDB[Amazon DynamoDB: papers / evidence / runs / publication lock]
  Editor --> Polly[Amazon Polly] --> FFmpeg[FFmpeg segment normalization]
  FFmpeg --> S3[Amazon S3: private drafts + published assets]
  DDB --> API
  S3 --> Output[Final weekly podcast / transcript / show notes / RSS]
  Output --> UI
  Editor --> CW[CloudWatch + OpenTelemetry]
  Secrets[AWS Secrets Manager] --> EC2
